REAPER's arrangement view
Region Management: Use regions to structure your song. Hold Shift while dragging in the timeline to create a region. You can then drag, reorder, or duplicate these regions to instantly rearrange your entire track.
Inline MIDI Editing: Press E on your keyboard to open the MIDI inline editor, allowing you to edit MIDI notes and CCs directly in the arrange view without opening a separate piano roll window.
Navigator Window: If you need a bird's-eye overview of your whole project, press Ctrl + Alt + V to open the Navigator window, which lets you click and drag to jump around massive sessions




